ke this blog private so I can just post my private thoughts and photos. It doesn't even really have to be posted online tbh if it's just for me.)</p>\n<p>(also some weird bugs... not sure why the steak pic is squashed like that but whatever, I'll figure it out later)</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Back at it","date":"October 15, 2026","description":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/2024-11-10-pixel/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Pixel"}},"next":null},"pageContext":{"id":"60d11a40-01ba-59fd-b4a4-b9c82ed604dc","previousPostId":"5dd20edd-f04c-516a-95dc-00289c5fb19f","nextPostId":null}},"staticQueryHashes":["3000541721","3274528899"],"slicesMap":{}}